      "general": {
        "abstract": "This site is located in Gonzalo Island in Diego Ramirez Archipelago, Chile. It is a sub-Antarctic Island located at 56oS. It is a sub-Antarctic ecosystem, dominated by Poa flagellata and characterized by an absence of trees. ",
